{"id":"pt_text_villon_pendus","title_original":"Villon, Ballade des pendus","title_ja":"ヴィヨン「絞首刑者のバラード」","author_name_display":"François Villon","era_year":1463,"era_period":"中世末期","culture_region":"中世ヨーロッパ","language_original":"fro","form_genre":"バラード","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Frères humains qui après nous vivez,\nN'ayez les cuers contre nous endurciz,\nCar, se pitié de nous povres avez","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://fr.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource fr","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_walther_polerei","title_original":"Walther von der Vogelweide, Ich saz uf eime steine","title_ja":"ヴァルター「私は石の上に座っていた」","author_name_display":"Walther von der Vogelweide","era_year":1198,"era_period":"ミンネザング","culture_region":"中世ヨーロッパ","language_original":"gmh","form_genre":"政治詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"Ich saz uf eime steine\nund dahte bein mit beine\ndar uf satzt' ich den ellenbogen","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://de.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"Wikisource de","canonical_tier":1},
