{"id":"pt_text_kanzan_4","title_original":"寒山詩「可笑寒山道」","title_ja":"寒山詩「可笑寒山道」","author_name_display":"寒山","era_year":750,"era_period":"唐","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩・禅偈","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"可笑寒山道，而無車馬蹤。\n聯溪難記曲，疊嶂不知重。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/寒山詩","source_archive":"維基文庫 / CBETA","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_kanzan_5","title_original":"寒山詩「重巖我卜居」","title_ja":"寒山詩「重巖我卜居」","author_name_display":"寒山","era_year":750,"era_period":"唐","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩・禅偈","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"重巖我卜居，鳥道絕人跡。\n庭際何所有，白雲抱幽石。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/寒山詩","source_archive":"維基文庫 / CBETA","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shide_1","title_original":"拾得詩 其一","title_ja":"拾得詩 第一","author_name_display":"拾得","era_year":750,"era_period":"唐","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩・禅偈","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"我見頑鈍人，燈心拄須彌。\n蟻子拽大樹，焉知不自量。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/","source_archive":"CBETA","canonical_tier":2},
