{"id":"pt_text_hakuin_zazenwasan","title_original":"白隠・坐禅和讃","title_ja":"白隠 坐禅和讃","author_name_display":"白隠慧鶴","era_year":1750,"era_period":"近世","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"和讃","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"衆生本来仏なり\n水と氷の如くにて\n水を離れて氷なく","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/坐禅和讃","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ryoukan_kaze","title_original":"良寛・漢詩「世の中は」","title_ja":"良寛 漢詩「世の中はなにかつねなる」","author_name_display":"良寛","era_year":1820,"era_period":"近世","culture_region":"仏典詩偈","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"和歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"世の中は なにかつねなる 飛鳥川\n昨日の淵ぞ 今日は瀬になる","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/index_pages/person146.html","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":2},
